  "description": "QELKAW crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C67 H99 Dy3 N6 O21 Zn3 4+,3(Cl1 O4 1-),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.449-4.061 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.77-114.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn3Dy3(μ6-CO3)(μ3-OH)3(L)3(H2O)3]·3(ClO4)·NO3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
